{"3647190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Malignant Survivors 2", "steam_appid": 3647190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647190/extras/0f1c536f3e763b50f72ace1dae52db47.avif?t=1788209517\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647190/extras_big/0f1c536f3e763b50f72ace1dae52db47.webp?t=1788209517 width=1560 height=233 /></span>Malignant Survivors 2 is a 3D horde roguelite with ARPG elements, and it's old-school and challenging. Only you will figure out how to solve problems and survive the madness, with the help of a bit of luck. Open chests, find boosts, run away, or charge into the horde; survive or die while experiencing the most crowded 3D combat ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647190/extras/63ca1b66b847aaffe275380b1e2eadc5.poster.avif?t=1788209517\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647190/extras/63ca1b66b847aaffe275380b1e2eadc5.webm?t=1788209517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647190/extras/63ca1b66b847aaffe275380b1e2eadc5.mp4?t=1788209517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The drops are not pre-designed; every barrel, every chest can drop anything. May the luck be with you.<br>There are approx. 1000~ base items + 50~ prefixes (those prefixes add new affixes to the item on drop).<br>** See what other people dropped on item leaderboards.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647190/extras/7f335222667a03ad7c7887ff62c19d33.poster.avif?t=1788209517\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647190/extras/7f335222667a03ad7c7887ff62c19d33.webm?t=1788209517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647190/extras/7f335222667a03ad7c7887ff62c19d33.mp4?t=1788209517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect crafting materials and upgrade/reroll your items with recipes. Results may surprise you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647190/extras/a811db033de6f367714960a16203664b.avif?t=1788209517\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647190/extras_big/a811db033de6f367714960a16203664b.webp?t=1788209517 width=1560 height=942 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But... you will die, eventually. Try other heroes, different builds, and different tactics to survive the horde.<br>If you are lucky and find a cool item on the run, maybe you can clear the realm with even a weaker build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647190/extras/2bd23b259911d0a77e3b35bff6239d5f.poster.avif?t=1788209517\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647190/extras/2bd23b259911d0a77e3b35bff6239d5f.webm?t=1788209517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647190/extras/2bd23b259911d0a77e3b35bff6239d5f.mp4?t=1788209517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_parag